  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Initially a patient at Rhodes Island, volunteered to become an Operator. He was assigned to Reserve Op Team A6 after completing his examination battery.",
        "zh": "作为患者进入罗德岛接受治疗，出于本人的意愿，在通过干员测试后，成为罗德岛的一员，被分配到预备行动组A6。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in his circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming him as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 8% \nMedical readings indicate subject has many symptoms of Oripathy. Oddly, subject has no visible crystallization on body. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.30u/L\nInfection is spreading at a constant rate. Regular observation and treatment mandatory.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】8%\n干员月见夜在医疗器械下，能发现明显的感染者症状。不过奇特的是，他的体表没有任何源石结晶。\n\n【血液内源石密度】0.30u/L\n感染步入中期，以这个势头发展下去，感染将匀速蔓延扩散。需要保持定期观察与控制。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A former host now assigned to Reserve Op Team A6. \nMidnight was the most popular producer at a prominent host club in the Far East. He broke earnings record several years in a row, and was known as the Devil of the Eastern Night. \nHe tends to speak boldly, even claiming he's here as God's gift to women. \nWhile he has never caused any real problems, he is still often a headache.",
        "zh": "预备行动组A6的一员，男公关出身。\n过去是东国某大型男公关俱乐部的头牌，曾连续数年打破上一年由自己创下的营业额记录，有着东夜魔王的别称。\n言行举止颇为浮夸，自称正是以此来让众多女性为自己一掷千金。\n虽然很少引发混乱，但经常会有令人头疼的行为。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Midnight doesn't know how he got infected. According to his own words, he was very quick to retire after his diagnosis. \nAfter retiring, he found Rhodes Island through prior connections and came for treatment.\nThen, after being in the program for a while, he made a peculiar request: He wanted work at Rhodes Island.",
        "zh": "月见夜先生感染矿石病的经由不明，按照本人的说法，他十分果断地在发现症状并通过个人渠道确诊后，为自己举办了谢幕式，从业界隐退。\n隐退后，他通过过去的人脉找到罗德岛，希望能够接受治疗。\n不过，在罗德岛接受治疗了一段时间之后，他提出了一个古怪的要求：希望能够作为干员加入罗德岛。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Midnight finally became a member of A6. \nAt first, even in eccentric A6, Midnight was widely considered the most difficult person to get along with. But after a while, everyone realized he was actually kind and hardworking. \nEven then, there are still many people, such as Orchid, who can't handle his wild boasts.",
        "zh": "月见夜先生最后成为了A6的一员。\n原本，即使在怪人云集的A6中，月见夜先生也被认为会是最难以相处的一个。但实际相处后，所有人都发现，月见夜先生其实是个努力而温柔的人。\n当然，即使如此，也依然还有许多人无法适应他的浮夸，比如梓兰。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "When Midnight cares about someone, he gives his whole heart, but that means only a few people can reciprocate on the same level. \nSince everyone is used to his hard work, they don't notice his exhaustion, which he wouldn't want them to notice, anyway. But it would be best for someone to check up on him once in a while.",
        "zh": "应该相信，月见夜先生能够对谁都付出真心，但这也意味着，很少有人能回报他同等的爱。\n当所有人都习惯了他的付出，他的疲惫就不会有人发觉——虽然他也不希望被发觉。但若真有那样的时刻，应该有那么一个人给他带去一些慰藉。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
